  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third Party Monitoring (TPM) of Humanitarian and Resilience Programme (HARP) in Northeast and Northwest Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the quality, accountability, and effectiveness of humanitarian aid in Northeast and Northwest Nigeria by independently monitoring how aid is delivered. It will provide impartial assessments of how well humanitarian partners are meeting the needs of vulnerable communities, including people displaced by conflict and climate-related disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
